{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "75aa1f85-23e5-8884-af54-9d8df389f8a1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T11:02:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T10:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T10:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Thank you for picking up. My name is Bridget Doyle. I am calling for my mother, about her house on Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T10:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What do you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T10:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We want to replace the fence. The old one is rotted, some boards are falling down. The new one goes in the same spot, same line as the old one. So, same spot, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What are you putting up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Composite. Six feet tall. Composite, six feet. And the guy who is going to do it, he wants to start soon. So I want to ask, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a new fence needs a permit, and a six-foot one definitely gets looked at. Even a replacement in the same spot usually goes through us first. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. It is 410 Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "410 Bellevue. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, [line breaks up] sorry, can you say again? The line is not good. I heard yes, you need a permit. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:00:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you need a permit. Have your contractor hold off until you have it in hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hold off until we have the permit. Good, thank you. And one more thing. Do we need a survey? Of the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:01:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can help. They'll want to see where the property line is and where the fence sits. If you have an old plot plan or survey from the closing, bring that. If not, we can talk about what else works when you apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So an old survey from when she bought, that is okay. If we don't have it, we ask again. Okay. [pause] My mother, she likes to sit on the back steps after dinner, so we want it nice and finished soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:01:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You can stop by the office or send in the application. Bring the fence height, material, and a sketch of where it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:01:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sketch, height, material. Yes. Composite, six feet, and the sketch. I write it down. Where is the office, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall on Broadway. Zoning and Inspections is in there. We're open weekdays during business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:02:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall, Broadway, weekdays. Okay. If I have a question after, can I call this number again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:02:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, this line works. Ask for me or whoever's here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:02:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you very much, Greg. Thank you. I will bring the papers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye bye, thank you."
    }
  ],
